+
+## JSON Merge Patch
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386) JSON
+Merge Patch and returns a new JSON value. Object patches merge recursively; a `null` member removes
+the corresponding target member, and any non-object patch replaces its target. Neither input is
+modified.
